(7615664, 1232314, 181814, '<td valign="top">I think what is supposed to be a white background is a bit sloppy, it''s not evenly lighted, and there is a lot of sensor dust present that could have been edited out. The texture of the knitted blanket looks okay, but the hat seems to be a bit odd.</td>', 'I think what is supposed to be a white background is a bit sloppy, it''s not evenly lighted, and there is a lot of sensor dust present that could have been edited out. The texture of the knitted blanket looks okay, but the hat seems to be a bit odd.', '2019-02-26 19:30:10.000000', NULL, 1),
